  "solution": "Given equation: 24 + 36 - 81 × 9 ÷ 2 = 42.\n\nBODMAS Table: \n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/d50192f098c21078501d30eeafe1a8c64bc30dd9621c48caa8a39ffc60f68b64.png] \n\nLet's check each option one by one.\n\nOption 1) ÷ and - \n\nGiven: 24 + 36 - 81 × 9 ÷ 2 = 42.\n\nAfter interchanging the signs we get;\n\n⇒ 24 + __**36 ÷ 81 × 9**__ - 2 = 42\n\n⇒ __**24 + 4**__ - 2 = 42\n\n⇒ __28____** - 2**__ = 42\n\n⇒ 26 ≠ 42\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nOption 2) × and + \n\nGiven: 24 + 36 - 81 × 9 ÷ 2 = 42.\n\nAfter interchanging the signs we get;\n\n⇒ 24 × 36 - 81 + __**9 ÷ 2**__ = 42\n\n⇒ __**24 ×**____** 36**__ - 81 + 4.5 = 42\n\n⇒ __**864**__ - 81 __**+ 4.5**__ = 42\n\n⇒ __**868.5 - 81**__ = 42\n\n⇒ 787.5 = 42\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nOption 3) ÷ and **×**\n\nGiven: 24 + 36 - 81 × 9 ÷ 2 = 42\n\nAfter interchanging the signs we get;\n\n⇒ 24 + 36 - __**81 **____**÷**____** 9**__ × 2 = 42\n\n⇒ 24 + 36 - __**9 × 2**__ = 42\n\n⇒ __**24 + 36**__ - 18 = 42\n\n⇒ __60** - **____**18**__ = 42\n\n⇒ **42** = 42\n\n⇒ LHS = RHS\n\nOption 4) + and -\n\nGiven: 24 + 36 - 81 × 9 ÷ 2 = 42\n\nAfter interchanging the signs we get;\n\n⇒ 24 - 36 + 81 × __**9 ÷ 2**__ = 42\n\n⇒ 24 - 36 + __**81 × **__**__4.5__** = 42\n\n⇒ __**24**__ - 36 __**+**____** **36____4.5__ = 42\n\n⇒ __388.5 - 36__ = 42\n\n⇒ 352.5 ≠ 42\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nHence, the correct answer is \"Option 3\".",
